<title>JAPAN: AuBEX -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>AuBEX -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.72		vs	    3.80</p>
<p> Operating	   38    million	  vs	   36    million</p>
<p> Current	     10    million	  vs	   17    million</p>
<p> Net		    8    million	  vs	   26    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.55 yen	  vs	    1.72 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     15 million	  vs	  15 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - AuBEX Corp started out as a hat maker, but is now shifting emphasis to textile products.</p>
</text>
